# NIBRS Crime Data Agent - Environment Configuration

# --- Required Configuration ---

# Google BigQuery Credentials (JSON string)
# Get your service account key from Google Cloud Console
# Convert the JSON file to a single-line string (no newlines)
# Tip: Use ./add-gcp-key.sh script to add this automatically
GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS_JSON={"type":"service_account","project_id":"your-project",...}

# Cerebras API Key
# Get your API key from https://cloud.cerebras.ai/
CEREBRAS_API_KEY=your_cerebras_api_key
